### 逐处错误标注
1. where would you choose to work → whether graduates choose to work in big cities or small cities  主语从句语序错误，且原题是二选一，这样表达贴合观点选择类话题
2. woking → working 拼写错误
3. fundamental facilities → infrastructure 地道固定表达，指基础设施
4. an extreme convenience → great convenience；convenience 是不可数名词，不能用 an 修饰；extreme 语气过重
5. When we want to go to hospital or take education → If we need medical treatment or further education 表达生硬，符合四级写作地道表达
6. it can bring you better resources → big cities can provide us with better resources 人称混乱，前面主语是 we，不能换成 you
7. much posibility → more possibilities；possibility 可数，much 修饰不可数名词；posibility 拼写错误
8. business chances → career opportunities 职场机会用 career opportunities 更合适
9. social recources → social resources 拼写错误
10. choosing big city → working in big cities；city 可数，需要冠词 / 复数，搭配不当
11. may take more resources to us → can bring us more valuable resources；take…to 是带走，bring 才是带来，逻辑相反
12. Nothing is impossible in big city → We have more room for self-improvement there 原句空话，不符合四级作文论证，改写贴合主题


### 修正版
  Nowadays, whether graduates choose to work in big cities or small cities has sparked plenty of discussion. Opinions vary from person to person. As far as I am concerned, I 
prefer working in a big city.
  For one thing, big cities have well-developed infrastructure and a good working environment. We can enjoy great convenience. If we need medical treatment or further education, 
big cities can provide us with better resources. For another, we have more chances to get career opportunities and high salaries. Rich in social resources, big cities help us 
seize these opportunities.
  From my perspective, working in big cities can bring us more valuable resources. We have more room for self-improvement there.


### 优化完整版（适配你之前的观点选择模板，142 词）
  When it comes to whether graduates choose to work in big cities or small cities, opinions vary from person to person. Some believe small cities offer a relaxing life, while 
others argue big cities are more attractive. As far as I am concerned, I prefer working in a big city.
  Those who support big cities claim that big cities are equipped with complete infrastructure and high-quality public resources. We can receive better education and medical 
services. However, others maintain that the high living cost in big cities brings huge pressure.
  As far as I am concerned, I prefer working in a big city. It provides abundant career opportunities and a higher income. We can constantly learn new things and make progress. 
Only in this way can we realize our personal value.
